      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I would love for this to also be added to the Quick Menu's Here tab, since it is faster to open and check.\nNot sure the ear icon was good enough though, since it would a little hard to see at a glace. Maybe slightly light up the boarder around the player's icon instead? This would just be a less intuitive meaning I guess. Maybe a \"sort by in hearing range\"?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
